  "summary": "Self-motivated Agile senior developer with over 30 years of experience in Financial IT.\n\nFormed in Switzerland in the banking industry I started as a Cobol developer. Through personal discipline and eagerness to learn new products and software, I mastered a multitude of tools/software through the years. I am currently a senior Ab Initio/Snowflake developer working for a global financial company. \n\nMy current job provides me the opportunity to work with software such as Ab Initio (as well as BRE) Autosys, SQL (Sybase/Oracle/SingleStore/Snowflake) , khs, and Python. I support/develop different business projects (such as ESG data, security hierarchy) and I participate in technical improvements.\n\nDue to my wide knowledge of systems, I am always happy to provide support and answer technical/business questions. \n\nCOVID showed me that I am way more productive working from home than in the office. My work has now become a hobby/passion. \n\nAlthough I have worked all these years in the financial industry, I am opened to change my focus should a good work-from-home opportunity come my way. \n",
